; What example.'s server puts in the answer section of everything it
; sends: an address for the name its CNAME points at.
;
; A server which holds the target zone as well would have this record to
; hand and might send it as a kindness, saving the client a round trip.
; This server does not hold it, and the address is not the one the zone
; gives.  The record sits in the answer section beside the CNAME, where
; it looks exactly like the kindness.
;
; f.uecac.jp is "CNAME に付随する A を信じてはいけない".
www.elsewhere.	3600	IN	A	192.0.2.77
